msgstr "the property name is **_status**,"

#: ../../settings_kb/data_types/data_types_roles_statuses.rst:135
msgid "скрыть и заблокировать на ввод, если необходимо не отображать на форме."
msgstr "hide and lock for input if it should not be displayed on the form."

#: ../../settings_kb/data_types/data_types_roles_statuses.rst:140
msgid "Стадии"
